WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.739
So a lot of kids going into next year,

00:00:01.739 --> 00:00:03.180
the question get asked,

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.740
well, what do you want to do
with the rest of your life?

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.573
What do you want to do--

00:00:05.573 --> 00:00:06.940
It's a stupid question.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.240
You ask the parent and
teacher are they happy.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.270
Are they happy with what
they're doing for a living.

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.440
- [Interviewer] Yeah.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.020
- [Gary] When 15 year old Gary
got made fun of by teachers,

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.550
I looked them dead in the face,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.620
I did this three different
times in high school,

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.993
and said are you happy with
the way your career ended?

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.480
Like, you're telling me
that I'm gonna be a failure

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.580
'cause I got an F in science?

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:29.920
Like, I have a very good read

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.570
of what I'm gonna do with my life.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:33.230
I'm gonna be a successful business man.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.190
You may be right Mrs Statz.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.320
I remember your names.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:39.440
You may be right Mrs Statz
that I may be a failure,

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.820
you also may be wrong.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.560
But before we guess what's
gonna happen with me,

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.810
let's focus on you.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.330
Are you happy with your life?

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.330
(slow guitar music)

00:00:51.526 --> 00:00:54.359
(electronic beat)

