agenda of the creative

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:37.759
and so,

00:03:37.759 --> 00:03:39.130
for me,

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.380
quantity is not debatable.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.000
I always tell my team,

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.890
