client was waiting for,

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:53.360
that's not a debate,
you are three days late.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:56.160
That is not subjective,
that's black and white.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.050
Once you deliver that work.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:01.800
